P27,760x648,760x620,736x539,"FIXED the same day. At .defaultSize(760,520) this window opened at its own minimum, 760x539, and SwiftCrossUI printed: vertical stack ran out of space: 8 children were offered 503 and took 533. At least one child was offered zero. The web view at the bottom was cut by the window edge. P27 has no buttons at all, so it is not the Button layout work of 2026-09-17 -- the number had simply been smaller than the content needs. Raised to 620: window 760x648, zero warnings."
